WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:33.140
Hey, hey, hey!

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.490
A battle on the second day of the second round!

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:39.040
Next up is the Wild Wyvern user,

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.090
Wakiya Komurasaki!

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.450
As expected from a favorite to win, he's composed!

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.330
Mmm, excellent!

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:47.390
First battle!

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.740
Now, just what kind of battle 
are we going to see here!?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.950
Ready, set!

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.360
Three, two, one...

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.350
Go Shoot!

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:04.470
Woo-hoo!

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.630
They're both Defense Types, and yet 
Wyvern has amazing spin power.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.890
What's this? Looks like I overestimated you.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.410
This should end in about three seconds.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.770
You ready? Watch.

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:20.600
Three, two...

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:21.590
One!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:27.320
Burst Finish!

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:30.790
2 to 1, Wakiya Komurasaki wins!

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.370
Looks like he won.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:44.530
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:44.530
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:50.000
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:50.000
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.580
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.580
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:00.460
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:00.460
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.720
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.720
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:11.810
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:11.810
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.730
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.730
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:21.860
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:21.860
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:28.080
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:28.080
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:32.580
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:32.580
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.790
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.790
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.500
<i>When two people (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.500
<i>zettai katsundatte iu</i>

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.800
<i>who've got the drive to win (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.800
<i>honki no omoi doushi ga</i>

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.800
<i>battle it out (Burst! Burst! Burst! Burst!)</i>

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.800
<i>butsukattara</i>

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.970
<i>bonds are formed (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.970
<i>kizuna ga umareru no sa</i>

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.640
<i>When it's time for the climax (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.640
<i>ketteiteki shunkan</i>

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.100
<i>face it off... together! (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.100
<i>oikakeyou... issho ni!</i>

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:55.390
<i>Can't stop, I'll finish this, with the! best! (Go!)</i>

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:55.390
<i>mou tomaranai, kimeru no sa  sai! kyou!</i>

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:59.110
<i>Burst Finish!</i>

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:59.110
<i>Baasuto Finisshu o!</i>

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.610
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.610
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:09.520
The Grim Reaper Descends!
The Jet-Black Deathscyther!!

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.020
Hey, everyone!

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.610
In the second round of the Regionals, 
I won with flying colors!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:18.410
Right now, I'm recovering 
stamina for the next battle!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:20.280
Valt!

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.990
Hurry and get up already!

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.240
You ready, Nika?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.000
Yep!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.500
One, two, three!

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:31.500
Bro! Get up!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.130
Late, late, I'm late!!

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:36.590
Wait, Valt!

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:37.470
Here!

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.840
Fresh from the oven. 
Eat it on the way there!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.300
Thanks, Mom!

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:43.930
I'm off!

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:51.480
Just need two more members to make the Bey Club!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:56.110
All right! Time to work hard!

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.110
So, you're late... again.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.910
Darn you, attendance!

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.660
Next battle, I'll win for sure!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.960
Think about things other than Beyblade.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:09.750
Hello?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.750
You're Valt Aoi, right?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.380
H-Hey, you're...

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:16.880
Who's that?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.970
Idiot! That's your next opponent, Daina Kurogami!

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:22.800
Oh! I saw him in the assembly hall!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.850
There's something off about him.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.310
His face is different.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:32.560
When I saw your matches, 
I instantly became a fan of yours!

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.690
Are you serious!?

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:38.900
Especially your Rush Shoot! 
You're really something, you know!

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.950
Thank you, thank you!

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:45.700
You hear that, Honcho? My fan! My very own fan!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.660
You sure he's got the right guy?

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.290
So, would it be alright if, um...

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.080
We could have a battle after school?

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.920
I've been really wanting to battle you,

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.590
so I couldn't wait any longer!

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:02.430
Of course I'd say yes!

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:03.300
Really!?

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.800
Yeah! We can battle any time!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.010
All right!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:10.890
If you want to, we can meet 
up in the gym after school!

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:14.060
Oh man, is school over already?

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.650
Okay, let's battle, let's battle!

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.230
Ready, Daina?

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.400
Yep! Thanks again!

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.990
It'd be an honor.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:27.240
Daina's Bey is Dark Deathscyther!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.830
Attack Type, just like Bro's!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.870
He was super strong! I can't wait to see this!

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.250
Okay, here we go.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.580
First battle.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:38.590
Ready, set!

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.170
Three, two, one...

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:43.430
Go Shoot!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.270
H-He missed his shoot?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:04.820
Valkyrie, Spin Finish, and one point lead... right?

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.410
Huh?

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.580
Totally different than before!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.330
Think he just got lucky?

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.080
W-What happened?

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.080
Did you get nervous or something?

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:15.960
Moron.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.540
It was obviously on purpose.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.250
On purpose...?

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.880
Hey, Daina, what do you mean "on purpose"?

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.680
I just wanted to see the Rush Shoot.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:30.100
Plus...

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.770
Your weakness, too.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:39.400
Hey! What're you doing!?

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.070
What are you getting mad about?

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:41.940
What!?

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:45.030
Either way, it's gonna end up like this tomorrow.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.120
Valkyrie!

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.200
Wait right there, Daina!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:57.960
Move.

00:06:58.670 --> 00:06:59.840
Apologize!

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.920
Apologize to Valkyrie!

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:02.880
Valt!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.880
You sure are annoying.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:12.010
Daina! You're not gonna get away with this!

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.600
Bro...

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.400
Now I'm really mad!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.730
Hey, Valt!

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.530
I said wait, Valt!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:24.900
Wait, wait up!

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.150
Where are you going, big brother!?

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:27.730
--Bro!

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.320
Just like I thought.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:34.200
Now he can't use the Rush Shoot anymore.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:35.980
Go Shoot!

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.610
Go Shoot!

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:42.710
That jerk!

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.550
Go Shoot!

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:02.110
Bro, you haven't gotten the 
Rush Shoot right even once yet.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:04.650
I... I know...

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.400
You sure Daina didn't do anything?

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.110
Like messing up your Bey.

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.200
There's nothing wrong with my Bey.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:14.830
Guh, I've gotta train! No other options!

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.700
All right, I'm gonna shoot a thousand times!

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:18.790
One!

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:22.500
Two!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:24.710
Three!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.130
Four!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:29.880
Five!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.300
Two-hundred and fifty six!

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:36.770
Two-hundred and fifty-seven!

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:38.480
Dang it!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.020
Hey, get up.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.940
I'll take you guys home, so get on.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.520
What about big brother?

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.530
Leave that dummy.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.070
Go Shoot!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:55.200
We're gonna go ahead and go.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:56.730
Darn!

00:08:59.070 --> 00:08:59.940
Darn!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:03.210
It's no good.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.710
Why isn't it working?

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:10.420
Either way, it'll end up like this tomorrow.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.430
Come on!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.010
Don't worry, partner!

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:16.760
I won't let something like that happen again!

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:19.270
Let's go, Rush Shoot!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.650
Hey. Valt?

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:30.990
Hey, Valt! Hey, get up!

00:09:30.990 --> 00:09:31.860
What happened?

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.450
Your stomach? What happ--

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.660
I'm hungry...

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.790
Yum!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.380
Seconds!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.960
How many has he had?

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:49.920
Geez.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.010
Here.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:52.920
Wahoo!

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.470
Shu, have you gotten better?

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:57.930
What's this called?

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:00.430
Spaghetti carbonara.

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:02.770
Don't talk with your mouth full.

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:04.600
Yum, yum!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:09.190
Are your mom and dad busy like always now?

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:11.650
Dad's at an academic conference,

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.990
and Mom's probably staying at the lab.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.200
That so?

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:20.830
Well, I still like Naporitan better 
than this Carbo-whatever stuff!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.830
See ya!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.210
See you later.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.540
Bye-bye.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.090
Thank you!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:38.800
So? Why were you training so hard earlier?

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:42.600
I can't do the Rush Shoot anymore...

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:47.480
I battled with Daina Kurogami at school today...

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.610
Daina Kurogami?

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.650
Just thinking about it makes me mad!

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:54.860
I won't lose to that jerk!

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.950
I'll get revenge for Valkyrie!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.320
This isn't good.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.240
So then, big bro!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.410
The puppeteers came over to play today!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:09.880
It was really fun! I made friends with them!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.790
That's good.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:13.460
We played so much! And then, and then...

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.380
Daina!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.550
Visiting hours are almost up.

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:17.720
Okay.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.220
Well, I'm going.

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:22.260
Big bro, your battle's tomorrow, right?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:23.970
You'll win? You'll win, right?

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:28.350
Jeez, Souta. You always get excited 
when there's a tournament.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:29.690
Hurry and sleep.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.730
All right, let's get your temp.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.020
Okay.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.820
I'll be fine, Souta.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.360
I'll win.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.880
Okay, boys and girls!

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:57.380
We're heading into the third round 
of the Beigoma Beyblade Regionals!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:00.890
Let's introduce the Bladers of the first match!

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:04.390
No one could've expected 
this one to make it this far!

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:07.520
Cinderella Boy, Valt Aoi!

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.770
And his opponent is a favorite to win!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:14.360
Mysterious Boy, Daina Kurogami!

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.110
Crush.

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:19.570
Drop.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:21.030
Hey!

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.950
What's with Valt?

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:29.460
Every time he gets mad, he loses all control.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.690
Calm down...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.290
I practiced, I'll be fine.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.130
Calm down, calm down.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:38.590
That gosh darn jerk...!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:40.550
First battle!

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.260
I'll show you, you jerk!

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.600
It worked even better than I thought it would.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.720
Ready, set!

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:50.810
Three, two, one...

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.150
Go Shoot!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.030
He screwed up!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:12:59.740
He's done it now!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.450
Valt Aoi misses his shoot!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.870
Valkyrie!

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:06.120
And Daina Kurogami has a nice shoot!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.330
Is the match already over!?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.540
Destroy him, Deathscyther!

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:24.800
Bro!

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:27.810
Valkyrie's been knocked out!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.640
Deathscyther, Over Finish, one point!

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.520
Calm down, Valt!

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.440
Just one more point.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:39.280
So has this miracle boy's luck

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:42.110
finally run out!?

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.360
What is he doing!?

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.120
He's falling right into his trap!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.580
Blader Valt, are you ready?

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.290
I'm starting the second battle.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.160
Yeah!

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:54.250
This isn't gonna work.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.880
But what do I do!?

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.670
How can I beat him!?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.800
Valt, focus.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.760
The one you're fighting here isn't Daina.

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.340
It's yourself.

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:06.930
What do I do...?

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.850
He won because he's got the basics down.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:13.890
Basics...

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:15.440
Okay!

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.190
Second battle!

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.650
Hey, look at his grip!

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:25.240
He's launching straight!

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:27.450
This isn't the form for the Rush Shoot!

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:33.000
Now, one point and it's the end for 
Valt Aoi, can he make a comeback!?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:35.460
Remember the basics...

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.460
Ready, set!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:38.840
Three!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:39.840
Two!

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:40.840
One!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:42.920
Go Shoot!

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:46.550
He did it!

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.760
He made the shot!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.890
It's faster than it's ever been!

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:51.930
Valkyrie's fast!

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:53.560
Contact with Deathscyther!

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:55.390
That's it, Valkyrie!

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.940
It's just speed. Go, Deathscyther!

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.540
Who was first!?

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.080
I dunno...

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.960
Simultaneous Burst Finish.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.190
No points.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.460
A draw!?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.230
We're heading to the next battle!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.050
It's just luck.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.720
Ready, set!

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:31.680
Three, two, one...

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:33.970
Go Shoot!

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.820
That mess-up in the first battle 
seems like a bad dream now.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:50.370
Another simultaneous Burst Finish!

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.620
What was it this time, referee!?

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:55.080
Draw! No points.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.330
Again!?

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:00.400
Unbelievable! This is one heck of a fight!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.920
Fourth battle!

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.170
Go Shoot!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:08.090
Draw! Draw! Draw!

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:12.640
It's the sixth battle, and it's all been draws!

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.270
And they've all been simultaneous Burst Finishes!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.640
Draw! No points!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:23.230
Awesome! This is freakin' awesome! 
I've never seen anything like this!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.650
Why isn't it over yet!?

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.110
All right!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:32.320
Partner, let's settle it with the next match!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.240
What's going on...!?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.700
Eighth Battle!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.620
Attack, attack!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:39.960
Keep going!

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.080
Woah, watch out!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.300
Yes, that's how you do it!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:48.170
Draw!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.470
Again...? Come on...

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:54.300
But... this is really fun!

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.470
Bro's all better now!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.980
He changed his own weakness into a weapon.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:04.650
Th-Th-This is the 7th Burst Finish in a row!

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.110
Will this fight ever end!?

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:10.400
He gets so angry, starts dazing off,

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:12.070
and loses sight of everything.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.740
Going through his head right now

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:17.950
is nothing besides how much fun Beyblade is to him.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:20.460
He forgot how mad he was.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.290
So, he's an idiot?

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.830
A good trait to have.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:25.290
That's not all.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.590
Valt's feet placement.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.920
Before, his left was in front, but now...

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.550
It's reversed!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.630
The way he holds the launcher,

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.050
and the way he pulls the string were different,

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:38.600
and just copying my form like it is was inefficient.

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:41.310
So he made his form unique!?

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.940
All of it subconsciously, too.

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.200
It's fine, Souta!

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.410
It'll be a little longer than planned.

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.450
I'll be the one on top in the end!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.830
Hey, Daina, you're really awesome!

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.330
Don't talk to me, brainless snot!

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.920
Battles like this are rare!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.790
Letting it end would be a waste!

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:10.960
<i>Big bro, again, again!</i>

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:12.510
<i>Please, please!</i>

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:15.180
I wanna battle like this forever!

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:18.430
<i>I wanna battle like this forever!</i>

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:19.430
<i>Can we!?</i>

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.720
<i>Don't be selfish.</i>

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:24.940
<i>This really will be the last! So, please, please!</i>

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:26.770
<i>Fine.</i>

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:27.940
<i>Yes!</i>

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.900
<i>Hey, big brother!</i>

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:35.910
Daina, I wanna battle with you again and again!

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.910
Thirteenth battle!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.380
He's gonna Rush Shoot!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.960
Hey, Shu, this might just be me, but...

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:51.880
What?

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.380
Something's weird about Daina now.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.840
Ready, set!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:58.090
Three!

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.390
Two!

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:00.640
One!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.310
Go Shoot!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.190
There is...

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.860
They're having fun!

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:11.690
Yeah!

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:16.400
Go, Valkyrie!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.370
Crush him, Deathscyther!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.730
Victory Valkyrie, Burst Finish!

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.690
2 to 1, Valt Aoi wins!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:49.730
--He won! 
 --He won!

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:50.940
He actually did it!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.570
That was an amazing battle!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:58.320
This long, long, long, long, long battle is finally over!

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:04.200
Even with 11 draws, Valt Aoi still 
manages to pull through in the end!

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.460
Daina!

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.580
What?

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:12.290
That was fun! I've never battled like that before!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:15.050
Let's do it again! Okay? Okay?

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:24.140
Hey, big bro! Beyblade really is fun, huh?

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:26.470
Yeah, it is.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:33.560
Oh, Daina! I heard all about it.

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.820
You had an amazing battle yesterday!

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.690
Who did you hear that from?

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.990
From Souta's friends in his room.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:44.830
Let's go, Souta!

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.490
Combine!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.290
Oh, Daina! You're late!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.960
Big bro, look at me!

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:53.460
What're you guys doing here!?

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:55.880
They came to scout you!

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.000
Hey.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:01.840
They wanna practice with you and get stronger!

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.720
You sure are cool, big bro!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:05.180
Souta...

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:07.770
I wanna battle you again!

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:10.980
So you should join the Bey Club!

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:15.770
No.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.780
Bam!

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:20.860
Like I'd be friends with you. Idiot.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:24.660
Why not!? Can't you read the atmosphere here!?

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.410
But...

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.830
About Valkyrie...

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:31.250
Sorry.

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:37.130
You gotta be more honest!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:43.010
Club!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:45.220
Club!

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:48.310
Club!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.900
Bey Club!

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.480
Bug off!

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:59.570
Come on, join the Bey Club!

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:02.650
Come on, Daina!

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:25.040
<i>With huge hopes stuffed in my bag</i>

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:25.040
<i>ookina kibou wo baggu ni tsumekonde</i>

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:31.530
<i>The train set off towards the future</i>

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:31.530
<i>ressha wa mirai e ima hashiri dashita</i>

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:37.130
<i>Holding the ticket to my dreams close</i>

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:37.130
<i>yume no kippu wo gyutto nigirishimete</i>

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:46.290
<i>I move forward, without a doubt in my mind</i>

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:46.290
<i>osorezu ni susumu mou keshite mayowanai kara</i>

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:50.730
<i>On these long and winding rails</i>

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:50.730
<i>hatenaku tsuzuku nagai reeru</i>

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:53.890
<i>Where you get off is up to you</i>

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:53.890
<i>shuuchakuten wa jibun de kimeru</i>

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:56.200
<i>Chase it, chase it</i>

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:56.200
<i>oikakete oikakete</i>

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:00.460
<i>I know your dreams will come true some day</i>

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:00.460
<i>mieru keshiki ga aru to boku wa shinjiteru</i>

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:06.200
<i>Run, keep running, run far</i>

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:06.200
<i>hashitte hashiri tsuzukete, kakenukeru</i>

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:10.330
<i>Get past the countless tears</i>

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:10.330
<i>ikutsumo no namida o koete</i>

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:13.310
<i>so we can be stronger</i>

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:13.310
<i>bokura wa tsuyoku naru</i>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:19.040
<i>Some day we'll get glory, so until then</i>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:19.040
<i>itsuka eikou o tsukamu sono hi made</i>

00:23:19.220 --> 00:23:22.600
<i>Turn your dreams into reality</i>

00:23:19.220 --> 00:23:22.600
<i>yume wa yume no mama janai</i>

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:26.950
<i>Our endless adventure continues</i>

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:26.950
<i>owarinai tabi wa tsuzuku</i>

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:40.030
Every time I Beybattle, I always screw up.

00:23:40.030 --> 00:23:42.410
Even though Valkyrie tries so hard!

00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:44.530
I can't let us lose because of me!

00:23:44.910 --> 00:23:48.250
Everyone's helping me to get stronger!

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:49.580
It makes me so glad!

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:54.290
Next time on Beyblade Burst: 
"Keep it Together! This is Special Training!!"

00:23:54.630 --> 00:23:57.340
Three, two, one...

00:23:57.340 --> 00:23:59.340
Go Shoot!
